WEBVTT

00:00:01.810 --> 00:00:03.010
Yukina-chan!

00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:05.420
Thank goodness, I was worried sick for you.

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:07.060
Nagisa-chan, I'm glad that you are
safe as well.

00:00:12.010 --> 00:00:14.440
Uhm...Why are those people here?

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:17.040
I don't know much about it either.

00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:20.210
Anyway, they don't seem to be
our enemy at the moment.

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:23.010
A-Ah...

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:27.520
You are Kasugaya Shizuri of the
Saikai Academy domain, right?

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:31.540
You saved me when I was in trouble.

00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:33.260
Thank you so much.

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:36.240
I'm Eguchi Yume of the
Tensou Gakken domain.

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:41.700
Eh! Wait, What does this mean, Himeragi Yukina?

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:43.260
Is there a problem?

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:46.180
That girl is really cute!

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:52.410
Even though seems to be cheeky, but
she greeted me well despite being tiny,

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:55.320
her cheeks are soft and her
skin is also smooth!

00:00:55.380 --> 00:00:59.300
Well, yeah...She's cute, I understand.

00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:00.940
Sorry if I seem to be cheeky.

00:01:01.310 --> 00:01:02.890
I get that a lot.

00:01:02.890 --> 00:01:06.240
It's not like that, I didn't mean
for it to sound bad.

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:07.810
You seem to be reliable,

00:01:07.860 --> 00:01:11.280
in short, the best person to be allied to.

00:01:11.440 --> 00:01:13.490
Allied to?

00:01:13.490 --> 00:01:17.600
Ho-ho! An alliance with
the Saikai Academy domain?!

00:01:17.620 --> 00:01:19.780
That's a good idea.

00:01:19.780 --> 00:01:22.180
After all, numbers are important
for fights.

00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:24.240
What do you think?

00:01:30.980 --> 00:01:33.050
Okay, please take care of me.

00:03:08.610 --> 00:03:11.080
This way, we bound our domains together.

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:12.490
This seems to be really simple.

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:14.480
It's like a friend request in a game.

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:17.680
Ah, halo-halo!

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:19.570
Do you hear my voice, Tank Rider?

00:03:19.570 --> 00:03:22.690
Oh! Indeed, I can hear you, Empress!

00:03:22.700 --> 00:03:26.940
We can communicate like this
after forming an alliance.

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:28.530
Thank goodness.

00:03:28.530 --> 00:03:31.330
That means that Kasugaya-san's
group arrived there safely.

00:03:31.330 --> 00:03:32.330
Huh?

00:03:32.330 --> 00:03:33.370
Empress?

00:03:33.530 --> 00:03:36.090
Tell Himeragi-san and
Kasugaya-san on my behalf.

00:03:36.380 --> 00:03:42.340
Don't go back to Saikai Academy,
but look for Kojou and join him.

00:03:42.770 --> 00:03:45.400
The enemy is not only Order The End...

00:03:45.430 --> 00:03:47.700
The true purpose of the Lords' War is...

00:03:49.670 --> 00:03:51.060
What does that mean?

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:53.450
She wants us to join up
with Akatsuki-senpai.

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:57.360
Worry about that later, there are
more pressing things right now.

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:04.420
There's more of them than before, isn't it?

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:06.700
I haven't asked for this kind of service.

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:11.900
It looks like the apostles will appear
based on the ranking of the domains.

00:04:14.330 --> 00:04:17.000
Tch! They already caught up?

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:19.580
That sword... Could it be?

00:04:20.200 --> 00:04:21.980
Dance, Ghoulah!

00:04:27.090 --> 00:04:29.260
That many apostles destroy in an instant...

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:34.220
Hey-Hey! Don't steal your Primogenitor's thunder.

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:37.890
You really cannot read the atmosphere,
Aladar.

00:04:38.680 --> 00:04:45.240
Your Highness. It's rare that you come back to this
world, you deliberately involved yourself in this mess.

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:47.340
What do you plan on doing?

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:49.510
What should I do?

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:54.750
With a fun event like this, I can't just
stand down and watch.

00:04:55.090 --> 00:05:00.320
It'll be an international problem
if you infiltrate this island.

00:05:00.330 --> 00:05:03.030
If it's known by the Dynasty of Destruction or the Chaos Bride...

00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:05.360
They won't say anything.

00:05:05.640 --> 00:05:09.160
Well, just watch it.
It's going to get interesting soon.

00:05:09.630 --> 00:05:10.450
Your Highness?!

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:20.720
That familiar! The Fourth Primogenitor?

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:22.660
It's faster than I thought.

00:05:24.680 --> 00:05:25.900
Senpai...

00:05:26.340 --> 00:05:28.330
Please go, Yukina-oneesan.

00:05:28.540 --> 00:05:32.330
We'll definitely protect this domain,
so don't worry.

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:38.970
I'll go with you.
If The Blood is defeated, this stupid Lords' War will be over, right?

00:05:43.640 --> 00:05:44.670
Senpai!

00:05:47.920 --> 00:05:50.500
This massive magical power...

00:05:51.190 --> 00:05:52.620
It's Akatsuki Kojou.

00:05:52.810 --> 00:05:59.220
It has nothing to do with you, since you
cannot move from here, Minamiya Natsuki.

00:06:00.440 --> 00:06:04.660
It's not that I can't move, I don't
need to move, Octopus girl.

00:06:05.780 --> 00:06:10.460
Is that disgusting body the price for
the contract with the Guardian?

00:06:10.530 --> 00:06:11.540
Shut up!

00:06:11.760 --> 00:06:15.860
You've only been in this prison for
15 years. What do you know?

00:06:16.330 --> 00:06:17.660
300 years.

00:06:19.030 --> 00:06:22.930
I've lived in the prison of an another
world for 300 years.

00:06:23.200 --> 00:06:24.460
Then I finally realized.

00:06:24.620 --> 00:06:31.410
No matter how much they were tortured, the criminals never repented.
Sin doesn't leave the world, it's only increasing.

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:35.000
There is no meaning of this prison's
existence.

00:06:35.360 --> 00:06:39.990
Is that why you're running away?
By abandoning your duty as a prison warden.

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:46.840
No! I told you I realized it, didn't I?
Only an absolute domination of fear could dissuade criminals.

00:06:46.890 --> 00:06:52.680
Therefore, the sinners are to be judged
immediately, cruelly and miserably.

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:56.770
So you cooperated with the Fourth
Primogenitor, who is a symbol of fear.

00:06:56.980 --> 00:07:01.340
Does that prevent the birth of sinners,
with them dominated with fear?

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:08.660
I see. You accepted the naive ideas of
The Blood, and he's making good use of you.

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:10.010
A Loser.

00:07:13.800 --> 00:07:17.200
That's not what that guy really wants.

00:07:17.250 --> 00:07:21.280
You can't deceive me with those words,
Witch of the Void.

00:07:21.430 --> 00:07:22.400
Deceive?

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:29.050
Why? I don't need to beat around the bush like that,
I can't easily release myself from your bind.

00:07:29.190 --> 00:07:30.680
Stop running off your mouth!

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:33.590
Are you sure it's okay not to
seal off my guardians?

00:07:33.840 --> 00:07:36.120
This is my prison.

00:07:36.290 --> 00:07:36.940
What?!

00:07:38.260 --> 00:07:41.050
Let's go!
Storm Breaker Axe!

00:07:47.130 --> 00:07:48.040
What happened?

00:07:48.090 --> 00:07:52.620
What, who the hell are you?
You are not Minamiya Natsuki!

00:07:53.650 --> 00:07:56.100
Good work, mountain monkey.

00:07:56.100 --> 00:07:57.000
What?!

00:07:57.000 --> 00:07:58.790
Stop it, Shtra D!

00:08:01.470 --> 00:08:08.840
I understand this situation, Witch of the Void.
What's your purpose of releasing us from this prison?

00:08:09.110 --> 00:08:12.160
I'm only thinking of releasing
you temporarily.

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:14.680
If you guys want it.

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:15.610
Hey!

00:08:15.610 --> 00:08:19.170
Did you think I would do
something you asked for?

00:08:19.210 --> 00:08:25.880
I think you will, if you know those guys,
Order The End's true identity.

00:08:27.260 --> 00:08:33.500
So, I got it.
Well, we'll do what you want.

00:08:33.510 --> 00:08:39.480
Tch, I don't like being used by you,
it's not the time to be your opponent.

00:08:39.590 --> 00:08:40.480
Damn!

00:08:40.520 --> 00:08:47.660
You've got 48 hours. If you hurt any unrelated
people, you will get back into prison immediately.

00:08:47.660 --> 00:08:48.480
Understand?

00:08:51.720 --> 00:08:52.810
Impossible?!

00:08:53.500 --> 00:08:58.380
In order to escape from me, you
released criminals from the Prison Barrier?

00:08:58.520 --> 00:09:01.260
What? You're still alive, Loser.

00:09:01.280 --> 00:09:03.720
If you say those words once again...

00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:06.160
What's going to happen? Loser.

00:09:06.210 --> 00:09:07.170
I'll kill you!

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:12.160
That's all you have?!

00:09:18.940 --> 00:09:21.820
Good grief, the shackles come off, huh?

00:09:22.690 --> 00:09:24.320
I've heard it before.

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:30.440
The Guardian of Minamiya Natsuki, Rheingold's apperance
will cause spacetime to be distorted.

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:35.900
Don't tell me...
That armor was used to suppress its' power.

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:44.300
I'm making your wish come true,
Goddess of Revenge.

00:09:44.300 --> 00:09:48.500
No-no! D-Don't do this, please!

00:09:48.540 --> 00:09:53.970
Punishment as cruel and miserable,
ugly and pathetic.

00:10:18.050 --> 00:10:20.620
Who are you really, The Blood?!

00:10:25.110 --> 00:10:31.090
Why did you lock me up on Onrai Island?
Why did you start this Lords' War?

00:10:35.650 --> 00:10:38.820
Why can you use the same Familiars as me?

00:10:40.720 --> 00:10:44.720
Why do you have the same face as Avrora?

00:10:46.880 --> 00:10:49.010
Come, Cor Tauri-Sucinum!

00:10:55.030 --> 00:10:57.820
I have already answered these questions.

00:10:58.110 --> 00:11:01.570
Because I am also the Fourth Primogenitor.

00:11:01.700 --> 00:11:02.420
What?

00:11:02.520 --> 00:11:04.550
Show up, Primus Sucinum!

00:11:06.460 --> 00:11:08.320
Mesarthim Adamas!

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:22.780
Another sword like Hawless?

00:11:24.970 --> 00:11:28.740
Do you know the true identity
of the familiars, Akatsuki Kojou?

00:11:29.900 --> 00:11:36.050
Beasts that originated from a vampire's own blood,
and summoned from another world.

00:11:36.150 --> 00:11:38.810
That explanation was not wrong.

00:11:39.590 --> 00:11:42.260
However, that's not the full truth.

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:47.480
The Familiars are grudges, hatred
and curses.

00:11:48.800 --> 00:11:51.500
By blaming the Cleansing
on the Sinful God Cain.

00:11:51.590 --> 00:11:58.560
Their tainted existence came from being transformed
into demons, even those who used to be Gods.

00:11:58.560 --> 00:12:03.220
They became cursed beasts
from their anger and despair.

00:12:03.960 --> 00:12:06.760
Those are the vampires' familiars.

00:12:09.130 --> 00:12:13.380
Lost Warlord, Fallgazer, Chaos Bride.

00:12:13.510 --> 00:12:20.770
The Three Primogenitors inherited the blood of the cursed
gods. They are the first and last generations of them.

00:12:21.500 --> 00:12:26.560
The immortality curse of the Tenbu, and
the strongest familiars were given to them.

00:12:26.850 --> 00:12:29.760
Tenbu?
The Gods of the ancient civilization?

00:12:30.340 --> 00:12:35.610
However, even using that curse, they
couldn't beat the Sinful God, Cain.

00:12:36.320 --> 00:12:43.000
That's why the last few survivors of the
Tenbu decided to create an artificial vampire.

00:12:43.120 --> 00:12:46.190
The world's strongest one,
The Fourth Primogenitor.

00:12:46.650 --> 00:12:52.350
For this reason, the familiars were necessary,
worthy of being called the strongest.

00:12:52.760 --> 00:12:55.440
For the new curse, they needed
massive amounts of power.

00:12:55.620 --> 00:13:00.450
Don't tell me...
They sacrificed lives...their own?

00:13:01.570 --> 00:13:09.500
Therefore, the Fourth Primogenitor must be the strongest vampire
of the world. For those who made sacrifices as part of the curse.

00:13:09.560 --> 00:13:12.240
You have a duty to prove that!

00:13:19.260 --> 00:13:23.700
So you started the Lords' War,
because of that?

00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:29.360
We exist in order to make the Fourth
Primogenitor the king of the entire world.

00:13:29.360 --> 00:13:34.080
By such a commotion on Itogami Island,
how could such a thing happen?

00:13:34.100 --> 00:13:37.160
No, it can happen.
Did you forget?

00:13:37.570 --> 00:13:42.420
Itogami Island is the altar of the Cleansing,
The Greatest Legacy of the Sinful God.

00:13:42.620 --> 00:13:48.580
If someone can get it through normal methods, then
the Primogenitors have no other choice than to move.

00:13:50.240 --> 00:13:55.560
My real name is "Kenon".
I'm the 0th Kaleid Blood.

00:13:55.720 --> 00:14:02.740
The prototype of Fourth Primogenitor and your shadow.
As well as the proxy of the curse.

00:14:03.210 --> 00:14:08.700
I'm going to use all the world I have left
to make you the king of the whole world!

00:14:08.740 --> 00:14:12.860
Before that, I'm going to beat you up,
and finish the Lords' War!

00:14:12.860 --> 00:14:13.930
It's useless.

00:14:14.130 --> 00:14:18.260
Compared with you who are still incomplete
at the moment, I am still stronger.

00:14:18.340 --> 00:14:21.160
Show up, Primus Glacies!

00:14:27.580 --> 00:14:31.060
I, Sword Shaman of the High God
and priestess of the Lion, beseech thee...

00:14:31.780 --> 00:14:36.563
Dawn light of exorcism, spirit wolf of snowy
mist, grant me the divine might of thy steel,

00:14:36.587 --> 00:14:38.730
that I may smite a hundred evil spirits!

00:14:48.350 --> 00:14:49.920
Are you okay, Senpai?

00:14:50.540 --> 00:14:51.490
Himeragi.

00:14:51.740 --> 00:14:58.610
Ah, jeez! As soon as I take my eyes off you,
again and again, you are still full of wounds!

00:14:58.800 --> 00:15:00.980
What are you thinking about?

00:15:01.090 --> 00:15:04.140
Hey? No... This is not the time to say such a thing.

00:15:05.700 --> 00:15:08.160
Please fight later!

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:11.170
Kasuko... Why are you also here?

00:15:11.170 --> 00:15:16.000
Obviously I came here to save you!
Jeez, I really worry.

00:15:16.410 --> 00:15:20.160
Be careful,
The Blood can use the same familiars as me.

00:15:21.020 --> 00:15:25.540
And that stuffy guy wasn't even hurt
by the magma.

00:15:26.370 --> 00:15:29.480
Their breath, they don't seem to
be ordinary people.

00:15:31.070 --> 00:15:32.700
That blue sword?

00:15:33.040 --> 00:15:35.320
I finally found you, Hawless!

00:15:36.130 --> 00:15:38.690
What's this about? Who are you?

00:15:38.690 --> 00:15:41.480
Shut up, the descendant of traitor!

00:15:41.480 --> 00:15:43.780
Who's and what did I betray? Huh?

00:15:43.850 --> 00:15:44.410
Kasuko!

00:15:44.430 --> 00:15:45.110
Senpai!

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:52.440
Be careful, please.
This attack is not magic.

00:15:57.250 --> 00:15:58.930
Don't tell me? That is..

00:16:06.760 --> 00:16:07.870
A dragon?!

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:17.850
You, that's enough!

00:16:26.010 --> 00:16:27.130
You are...

00:16:49.590 --> 00:16:51.940
Has the spatial distortion disappeared?

00:16:54.130 --> 00:17:00.010
As I thought, Meriloe can't hold her back.
As expected of Witch of the Void.

00:17:00.320 --> 00:17:04.340
But it looks like it was in time.
It's time we retreated.

00:17:04.340 --> 00:17:05.240
Understood.

00:17:07.720 --> 00:17:09.360
Daughter of Castiella,

00:17:09.610 --> 00:17:13.480
Next time, I'll definitely kill you.
Take back the sword which belongs to us.

00:17:13.520 --> 00:17:15.170
What are you talking about?

00:17:15.280 --> 00:17:18.340
See you next time, Akatsuki Kojou.

00:17:22.050 --> 00:17:23.050
I won't let you go!

00:17:23.360 --> 00:17:25.440
No, Senpai, look at that!

00:17:28.040 --> 00:17:30.290
What the hell is that? That thing...

00:17:31.210 --> 00:17:32.160
That's...

00:17:37.800 --> 00:17:42.220
The Third Primogenitor who rules
the Chaos Zone, Chaos Bride.

00:17:43.580 --> 00:17:46.280
Why are you here,
Giada?!

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:55.080
That's military planes.
Which country are they from?

00:17:55.270 --> 00:17:57.320
The nationality identification signal is...

00:17:57.340 --> 00:18:01.300
Did they finally come?!
The cowards who withdrew from soceity.

00:18:02.310 --> 00:18:03.650
I've been waiting for you.

00:18:04.060 --> 00:18:06.370
What?! The Dynasty of Destruction.

00:18:06.370 --> 00:18:11.120
These are the Second Primogenitor's,
Fallgazer's, Aswad-Guul Aziz's special planes.

00:18:12.730 --> 00:18:14.930
Your Highness, what does this mean?

00:18:15.070 --> 00:18:17.200
Why did the Dynasty of Destruction
come to this island?

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:18.260
Isn't that obvious?

00:18:19.510 --> 00:18:23.880
In order to participate in the Lords' War
of Itogami Island.

00:18:24.510 --> 00:18:27.700
Veres, call the Imperial Knights.

00:18:28.030 --> 00:18:29.580
You brought them with you, didn't you?

00:18:29.880 --> 00:18:37.800
Yes. But, Your Highness' Knight Guards, the
pride of our Warlord's Empire, where are they?

00:18:38.020 --> 00:18:39.600
They're already here.

00:18:52.640 --> 00:18:56.940
Looks like the subordinates of the old witch,
who like to wear heavy makeup are here too.

00:18:57.060 --> 00:19:03.120
Those are...the submarines of the
Chaos Zone are here as well.

00:19:05.930 --> 00:19:08.200
That's what happened,
Little Lord Candidate.

00:19:09.900 --> 00:19:15.850
As the lord of the Warlord's Empire,
Ki Juranbarada, I request an alliance with you.

00:19:16.030 --> 00:19:17.940
An alliance?

00:19:18.170 --> 00:19:23.960
First of all, we shall take control of the West Island,
and ensure the safety of its citizens.

00:19:24.100 --> 00:19:28.710
Neither Order the End, nor any other primogenitors
will be allowed to touch them.

00:19:29.030 --> 00:19:31.160
How about, are you in for the ride?

00:21:02.600 --> 00:21:05.160
The Dynasty of Destruction control
the eastern part of the island.

00:21:05.240 --> 00:21:07.300
The west is controlled by the
Warlord's Empire.

00:21:07.300 --> 00:21:10.370
The Chaos Zone's troops occupy
the southern part of the island.

00:21:10.690 --> 00:21:16.310
But Keystone Gate is still occupied
by Order The End.

00:21:16.690 --> 00:21:22.240
The Primogenitors really gathered
on Itogami Island. My head is spinning.

00:21:22.250 --> 00:21:29.620
Yeah, that looks so fun, uhm, in such a difficult
period of time. I'm sorry, that's all I could do.

00:21:29.860 --> 00:21:35.380
The Kingdom of Aldegyr has no right to participate
in the Lords' War, so I cannot help directly.

00:21:35.500 --> 00:21:43.720
It's enough to send me here.
But... Princess, what is this outfit?

00:21:43.740 --> 00:21:45.770
The location of Kojou is unknown.

00:21:45.870 --> 00:21:52.060
But, just before sunset, in the northern part of island,
we have confirmed the fight between two primogenitors.

00:21:53.200 --> 00:21:54.880
I wish you tons of luck, Sayaka.

00:21:54.880 --> 00:21:55.420
Eh?

00:22:07.490 --> 00:22:08.380
Huh?!

00:22:08.980 --> 00:22:09.800
What's up?

00:22:09.950 --> 00:22:14.380
No... I thought I heard a scream of Kirasaka just now.

00:22:14.400 --> 00:22:15.650
It's just your imagination.

00:22:15.730 --> 00:22:16.820
He-he!

00:22:16.820 --> 00:22:19.890
I don't worry about her one bit, okay?

00:22:19.970 --> 00:22:21.620
Okay-okay, I understand.

00:22:22.620 --> 00:22:24.060
Hey, Shio-chan.

00:22:24.210 --> 00:22:27.320
Is it really a good idea to make
this girl meet Kojou?

00:22:28.300 --> 00:22:32.370
Didn't she say it she was necessary
to end the Lords' War?

00:22:32.370 --> 00:22:36.150
But...you see...This girl...
is really cute.

00:22:36.300 --> 00:22:37.980
C-Cute?

00:22:38.610 --> 00:22:44.530
I always thought it was strange.
Why didn't Kojou-kun go out with Yukki?

00:22:44.590 --> 00:22:45.260
What?!

00:22:45.640 --> 00:22:47.120
I mean, it's Yukki!

00:22:47.250 --> 00:22:51.560
Being observed by such a cute creature,
and they are together all day.

00:22:51.710 --> 00:22:53.930
Isn't it impossible not to fall in love with her?

00:22:53.930 --> 00:22:56.950
No...Himeragi also has the right to choose.

00:22:56.970 --> 00:22:59.930
Besides, Akatsuki Kojou might
love someone else.

00:22:59.990 --> 00:23:01.720
Yes. That's it, Shio-chan!

00:23:01.720 --> 00:23:02.450
Eh?

00:23:02.720 --> 00:23:06.770
That's what I mean,
Kojou-kun might love someone else.

00:23:06.990 --> 00:23:10.570
You mean it could be this girl?

00:23:14.520 --> 00:23:18.830
Simurgh?
Why is that mythical bird in a place like this?

00:23:19.160 --> 00:23:22.580
The Steel-colored Dragon
and the Demon Hunter girls.

00:23:23.020 --> 00:23:29.100
It's an interesting combination, isn't it?
Very interesting, indeed.

00:23:33.130 --> 00:23:36.000
Familiars?
Did she summon all them?

00:23:36.000 --> 00:23:38.080
That many by her alone.

00:23:39.740 --> 00:23:41.300
Don't tell me... She would be...

00:23:41.520 --> 00:23:45.820
No, that person is...
The Second Primogenitor, Fallgazer!

00:23:46.110 --> 00:23:48.730
Glenda, drop fast when I make the signal!

00:23:49.580 --> 00:23:54.710
It might wobble, hold on tight.
Are you ready, Avrora-chan?

00:23:55.060 --> 00:23:57.450
I... forgive you!
